menu "Memory Management Configuration"

choice 
    prompt "Select Memory Management Strategy"
    default MM_SIMPLE

config MM_SIMPLE
    bool "Simple First-Fit Memory Allocator"
    help
      A simple memory allocator that uses a first-fit strategy. 
      It maintains a linked list of free blocks and splits them as needed.
      This allocator is easy to implement but may lead to fragmentation over time.


endchoice



choice 
    prompt "Enable Memory Management Debugging"
    default MM_DEBUG

config MM_DEBUG
    bool "Enable Debugging for Memory Management"
    depends on MM_SIMPLE
    help
      Enable additional debugging output for the simple memory allocator. 
      This can help identify issues with memory allocation and deallocation, 
      but may reduce performance due to increased logging.
endchoice

endmenu